; Declination fixture for the [Declination] tests: one leaf block per way a
; Survex file sets the declination cavern applies to a block's shots.
;   fileset  *calibrate declination 2.5, which cavern applies as -2.5
;   modern   *declination 3.25 degrees, applied as +3.25
;   autoset  *declination auto, IGRF at the given point on the block's date
;   silent   nothing, so cavern applies 0
;   child    nothing itself, inheriting parent's *calibrate declination 1
;   mixed    changes the declination between its two shots
; Every block is dated, and the equates tie them all to fileset.f1's fix.
*date 2020.06.01
*cs out EPSG:32616
*cs EPSG:32616
*fix fileset.f1 600000 4100000 200
*equate fileset.f2 modern.m1
*equate modern.m2 autoset.a1
*equate autoset.a2 silent.s1
*equate silent.s2 parent.child.c1
*equate parent.child.c2 mixed.x1
*data normal from to tape compass clino

*begin fileset
*calibrate declination 2.5
f1 f2 10.0 0 0
*end fileset

*begin modern
*declination 3.25 degrees
m1 m2 10.0 90 0
*end modern

*begin autoset
*declination auto 600000 4100000 200
a1 a2 10.0 180 0
*end autoset

*begin silent
s1 s2 10.0 270 0
*end silent

*begin parent
*calibrate declination 1
*begin child
c1 c2 10.0 45 0
*end child
*end parent

*begin mixed
*declination 1.5 degrees
x1 x2 10.0 135 0
*declination 2.5 degrees
x2 x3 10.0 225 0
*end mixed
